  m_text: "\nYour goal is to collect all the evil bubbles and clean up the world!!
    \n\nMovement : A and D keys\nFloating: Spacebar\nPause: ESC\nOn the top right
    there is a big bubble, this is your float cooldown! \nwhen it runs out you will
    fall!\n\nYou can access this menu again by clicking the H key\nGoodluck Bubble
    Floaty Mcgee!!\n"
